WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.417
(rock music)

00:00:10.840 --> 00:00:13.210
- [Corinna] I think the history
of women and motorcycling

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:15.080
is really interesting because women

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:16.750
have always been doing it.

00:00:16.750 --> 00:00:18.260
When I started the Miss Fires,

00:00:18.260 --> 00:00:20.470
I'd been riding for a really long time,

00:00:20.470 --> 00:00:21.930
but, I never saw women.

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:24.830
The minute that we put the
call out there were 10 girls

00:00:24.830 --> 00:00:26.180
and then, the next week, there were 20

00:00:26.180 --> 00:00:28.550
and you know, six months
later, there's 150

00:00:28.550 --> 00:00:29.383
and now, there's, you know,

00:00:29.383 --> 00:00:32.700
over 250 across the United States.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:34.940
We always joke that it was
a thing that we didn't know

00:00:34.940 --> 00:00:36.550
that we needed until we had it

00:00:36.550 --> 00:00:39.310
and then, we couldn't
imagine life without it.

00:00:39.310 --> 00:00:41.890
I do have my own shop in New York City,

00:00:41.890 --> 00:00:44.860
which, does custom motorcycle
seats and upholstery,

00:00:44.860 --> 00:00:46.500
but, I'm currently run
away with the circus

00:00:46.500 --> 00:00:47.910
with the Wall of Death.

00:00:47.910 --> 00:00:49.826
(motorcycle engine)

00:00:49.826 --> 00:00:51.890
The Wall of Death is,

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:52.830
it's wild.

00:00:52.830 --> 00:00:56.370
They're riding motorcycles
sideways on a vertical wall.

00:00:56.370 --> 00:00:57.910
Samantha Morgan who must be one

00:00:57.910 --> 00:01:00.770
of the most famous 20th
century wall riders,

00:01:00.770 --> 00:01:03.570
I work at the wall that she did ride at.

00:01:03.570 --> 00:01:07.060
There are very few
industries where you have men

00:01:07.060 --> 00:01:09.680
being inspired and following
in the footsteps of the woman,

00:01:09.680 --> 00:01:11.440
not doing it for a woman, but,

00:01:11.440 --> 00:01:15.110
because some lady blew their minds.

00:01:15.110 --> 00:01:18.550
The Wall of Death is living history.

00:01:18.550 --> 00:01:21.370
In 1916, the Van Buren sisters motorcycled

00:01:21.370 --> 00:01:23.170
from Brooklyn to San Francisco to prove

00:01:23.170 --> 00:01:25.720
that women could be dispatch
riders in World War I.

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:28.300
They were even arrested several times

00:01:28.300 --> 00:01:30.970
for wearing men's clothing,
illegal in most states,

00:01:30.970 --> 00:01:33.230
which, really was just protective gear

00:01:33.230 --> 00:01:34.070
and after all that,

00:01:34.070 --> 00:01:36.480
the Army still rejected
their applications.

00:01:36.480 --> 00:01:39.610
That history and the list
of women over the years

00:01:39.610 --> 00:01:42.310
that have done this is
important for me to keep going.

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:45.790
The really cool thing is trying

00:01:45.790 --> 00:01:47.930
to connect younger generations of riders

00:01:47.930 --> 00:01:49.740
to an older generation of riders

00:01:49.740 --> 00:01:52.360
and so, I'm on my way to meet Becky Brown,

00:01:52.360 --> 00:01:54.700
founder of Women in the Wind.

00:01:54.700 --> 00:01:59.370
- I first started riding
motorcycles in 1976,

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:02.320
but, I didn't know one
single woman who rode.

00:02:02.320 --> 00:02:05.110
So, I actually put an ad
in the local newspapers

00:02:05.110 --> 00:02:07.290
and it really blossomed from there.

00:02:07.290 --> 00:02:10.720
We now, have 135 chapters
of Women in the Wind.

00:02:10.720 --> 00:02:15.463
We have 'em as far away as
New Zealand, Australia, Nepal.

00:02:16.860 --> 00:02:19.320
- Traveling on the road
is absolutely freedom

00:02:19.320 --> 00:02:22.270
to be able to hop on a
motorcycle and just go,

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:24.010
rain, hail, cold, and heat,

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:25.620
that bike gets me where I need to go.

00:02:25.620 --> 00:02:27.550
Whether you're by yourself, with a friend,

00:02:27.550 --> 00:02:28.770
or with a few people,

00:02:28.770 --> 00:02:30.543
you would find adventure partners.

00:02:31.790 --> 00:02:35.480
- Corinna, I'm so glad you could make it.

00:02:35.480 --> 00:02:37.610
This is some of the girls
from my Toledo chapter.

00:02:37.610 --> 00:02:38.720
- Just some of them?

00:02:38.720 --> 00:02:40.490
- Just some of them.
(laugh)

00:02:40.490 --> 00:02:43.940
I think that knowing that they
have a family of other women

00:02:43.940 --> 00:02:46.800
to get together and ride
with, it's wonderful.

00:02:46.800 --> 00:02:49.883
Women who ride motorcycles,
we're not afraid do anything.

00:02:50.950 --> 00:02:51.981
It's an adventure.

00:02:51.981 --> 00:02:54.398
(rock music)

00:02:58.719 --> 00:03:01.719
(gentle music beat)

